      <p class="text-sm text-brand-500 font-medium mb-2">{cat}</p>
      <h1 class="font-heading text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Solana Firedancer Upgrade 2026: Complete Guide to How Solana\'s 2nd Validator Client Transforms Meme Coin Trading</h1>
      <time class="text-sm text-gray-500">2026</time>
      
      <div class="mt-3 flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-800 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">solana</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-800 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">infrastructure</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-800 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">trading</span>
        <span class="text-xs bg-gray-800 text-gray-300 px-2 py-1 rounded">technology</span>
